<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_58f849907b52e99bd23af800f8d763a8229c9f259761916e6f9cd2caf9fafd1d_n0026/e_0326> <http://digistrucmed.org/spanConfidence> "0.9"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_58f849907b52e99bd23af800f8d763a8229c9f259761916e6f9cd2caf9fafd1d_n0026/tu_0009> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Lidocaine (IB)\nIV: 1 mg/kg bolus, 1-3 mg/min\n1-1.5 mg/kg. Repeat 0.5-0.75 mg/kg bolus every 5-10 min (max cumulative dose 3 mg/kg). Maintenance infusion is 1-4 mg/min although one could start at 0.5 mg/min\nVT, VF\nI_{Na}\nNo marked effect on most intervals; QTc can slightly shorten\nInitial\nt_{1/2}\n7-30 min; terminal 90-120 min. Prolonged in HF, liver disease, shock, severe renal disease\nMetab: H\nExcr: U\nCardiac: Bradycardia, hemodynamic collapse, AVB, sinus arrest\nOther: Delirium, psychosis, seizure, nausea, tinnitus, dyspnea, bronchospasm" .
